msgid "Install or remove a TUN system service (Linux systemd; macOS LaunchDaemon)."
msgstr "安装或移除 TUN 系统服务（Linux systemd；macOS LaunchDaemon）。"

msgid ""
"Manage a platform service for `tun up --foreground --system`. Requires root. Refuses to install if this binary is under a user-writable path. Identity defaults to /etc/link-p2p/identity.key (copied from the sudo caller's config when missing). macOS runs as root LaunchDaemon; Linux uses a dedicated service user with CAP_NET_ADMIN."
msgstr ""
"为 `tun up --foreground --system` 管理平台服务。须 root。若二进制位于用户可写路径则拒绝安装。身份默认 /etc/link-p2p/identity.key（缺失时从 sudo 调用者配置复制）。macOS 以 root LaunchDaemon 运行；Linux 使用带 CAP_NET_ADMIN 的专用服务用户。"

msgid "Install the TUN system service and start it."
msgstr "安装 TUN 系统服务并启动。"

msgid "Service identity key path (default /etc/link-p2p/identity.key)."
msgstr "服务身份密钥路径（默认 /etc/link-p2p/identity.key）。"

msgid ""
"Linux systemd only: Unix user the service runs as (default link-p2p). Ignored on macOS (root LaunchDaemon)."
msgstr ""
"仅 Linux systemd：服务运行的 Unix 用户（默认 link-p2p）。macOS 忽略（root LaunchDaemon）。"

msgid "Disable and remove the TUN system service."
msgstr "禁用并移除 TUN 系统服务。"

msgid "`hub`, `spoke`, or `phone`. Default: spoke if `--to` is set, otherwise hub."
msgstr "`hub`、`spoke` 或 `phone`。默认：若设置了 `--to` 则为 spoke，否则为 hub。"

msgid ""
"Make machines reachable at the IP layer over QUIC datagrams.\n"
"\n"
"Creates a TUN interface (needs root / CAP_NET_ADMIN on Linux and macOS, or Administrator + wintun.dll on Windows). Preferred day-to-day commands: `tun call` (1:1 phone), `tun join <hub>` (mesh channel), `tun status` / `tun peers` / `tun down`. Also `tun up --role phone|hub|spoke`. Foreground aliases: `tun serve` / `tun connect`. Prefer `--cc bbr3` on lossy paths. Virtual IPs are IPv4 only — see docs/subsystems/tun.md."
msgstr ""
"通过 QUIC datagram 在 IP 层打通整机互通。\n"
"\n"
"创建 TUN 接口（Linux/macOS 需要 root / CAP_NET_ADMIN；Windows 需要管理员与二进制旁的 wintun.dll）。日常优先用 `tun call`（点对点电话）、`tun join <hub>`（加入网络频道）、`tun status` / `tun peers` / `tun down`。也可用 `tun up --role phone|hub|spoke`。前台别名：`tun serve` / `tun connect`。丢包路径建议 `--cc bbr3`。虚拟 IP 仅 IPv4——见 docs/subsystems/tun.md。"

msgid "Start the TUN mesh daemon (or run foreground with --foreground)."
msgstr "启动 TUN mesh daemon（或用 --foreground 前台运行）。"

msgid ""
"Start the TUN mesh.\n"
"\n"
"Without `--foreground`, spawns a background daemon and returns after it is ready (Unix today; on Windows use `--foreground`). With `--foreground`, blocks like `tun serve` / `tun connect` (same code paths).\n"
"\n"
"Role defaults: if `--to` is set, role is `spoke`; otherwise `hub`. Roles: `hub`, `spoke`, `phone`. Do not pass `--role hub`/`phone` together with `--to`. `--role spoke` requires `--to <hub>`.\n"
"\n"
"Already-running daemon → usage error (exit 2). Ready timeout → exit 4 (check tun.log). Init failure reported by the child → exit 3."
msgstr ""
"启动 TUN mesh。\n"
"\n"
"不加 `--foreground` 时在后台拉起 daemon，就绪后返回（目前 Unix；Windows 请用 `--foreground`）。加 `--foreground` 时像 `tun serve` / `tun connect` 一样阻塞（同一代码路径）。\n"
"\n"
"角色默认：有 `--to` 则为 `spoke`，否则 `hub`。可选角色：`hub`、`spoke`、`phone`。不要把 `--role hub`/`phone` 与 `--to` 一起用。`--role spoke` 需要 `--to <hub>`。\n"
"\n"
"已在运行 → 用法错误（退出码 2）。就绪超时 → 退出码 4（查看 tun.log）。子进程初始化失败 → 退出码 3。"

msgid "Run in the foreground instead of daemonizing (alias of `tun serve` / `tun connect`)."
msgstr "前台运行而不 daemonize（`tun serve` / `tun connect` 的别名）。"

msgid "Direct address hint(s) for the hub (foreground spoke only) — see `connect --to-addr`."
msgstr "hub 的直连地址提示（仅前台 spoke）——见 `connect --to-addr`。"

msgid "Stop the background TUN daemon."
msgstr "停止后台 TUN daemon。"

msgid "Ask the local TUN daemon to shut down and wait until it is gone. Safe to call when nothing is running (exit 0). Use `--system` for the supervisor-managed daemon."
msgstr "请求本地 TUN daemon 关闭并等待其退出。未运行时调用也安全（退出码 0）。受管服务请用 `--system`。"

msgid "Target the system-service daemon (fixed runtime paths)."
msgstr "针对系统服务 daemon（固定运行时路径）。"

msgid "Show TUN daemon status (role, VIP, path, uptime)."
msgstr "显示 TUN daemon 状态（角色、VIP、路径、uptime）。"

msgid "Query the system-service daemon (fixed runtime paths)."
msgstr "查询系统服务 daemon（固定运行时路径）。"

msgid "List mesh peers known to the local TUN daemon."
msgstr "列出本地 TUN daemon 已知的 mesh 对等节点。"

msgid "Hub: roster + fallback forward for the virtual IP mesh (foreground)."
msgstr "Hub：虚拟 IP mesh 的 roster + 回退转发（前台）。"

msgid "Hub: accept many concurrent peers, broadcast the VIP↔EndpointId roster, bridge this machine to each at the IP layer, and forward traffic when spokes have no direct path. Prints this node's virtual IP and EndpointId. Equivalent to `tun up --foreground --role hub`."
msgstr "Hub：接受多个并发对端，广播 VIP↔EndpointId roster，在 IP 层桥接本机与各对端，并在 spoke 无直连时转发。打印本节点虚拟 IP 与 EndpointId。等同 `tun up --foreground --role hub`。"

msgid "Dial a hub, join the mesh, and try direct peer links (foreground)."
msgstr "拨号到 hub、加入 mesh，并尝试直连对等节点（前台）。"

msgid "Dial a `tun serve` hub, install 172.24.0.0/16 on the TUN, receive the mesh roster, and attempt direct links to other spokes (packets prefer direct; otherwise via hub). Equivalent to `tun up --foreground --role spoke --to <hub>`."
msgstr "拨号到 `tun serve` hub，在 TUN 上安装 172.24.0.0/16，接收 mesh roster，并尝试与其他 spoke 直连（包优先直连，否则经 hub）。等同 `tun up --foreground --role spoke --to <hub>`。"


