msgid ""
"1:1 TUN calls via the local daemon (remote-control).\n"
"\n"
"`tun call <contact|id>` — start phone daemon if needed, dial, short-poll status.\n"
"`tun call accept <peer>` / `tun call reject <peer>` — decide a ringing stranger call.\n"
"Known contacts auto-accept; unknowns ring until accept/reject/timeout.\n"
"See also `tun ring` and daemon logs (`tun.log`)."
msgstr ""
"通过本地 daemon（遥控器）发起 1:1 TUN 通话。\n"
"\n"
"`tun call <联系人|id>` — 必要时启动 phone daemon，拨号并短轮询状态。\n"
"`tun call accept <peer>` / `tun call reject <peer>` — 处理陌生人响铃来电。\n"
"已知联系人自动接听；未知来电响铃直至接听/拒接/超时。\n"
"另见 `tun ring` 与 daemon 日志（`tun.log`）。"

msgid "Enqueue the dial and exit without polling status."
msgstr "只排队拨号并退出，不轮询状态。"

