msgid ""
"Make machines reachable at the IP layer over QUIC datagrams.\n"
"\n"
"Creates a TUN interface (needs root / CAP_NET_ADMIN on Linux and macOS, or Administrator + wintun.dll on Windows). Preferred day-to-day commands: `tun call` (1:1 phone), `tun join <hub>` (mesh channel), `tun status` / `tun peers` / `tun down`. Also `tun up --role phone|hub|spoke`. Foreground aliases: `tun serve` / `tun connect`. Prefer `--cc bbr3` on lossy paths. Dual-stack VIPs: 172.24.0.0/16 and fd24:ac18::/64 (omit --tun-ip/--tun-ip6 to auto-pick on collision) — see docs/subsystems/tun.md."
msgstr ""
"在 IP 层通过 QUIC 数据报实现整机互通。\n"
"\n"
"创建 TUN 接口（Linux/macOS 需 root / CAP_NET_ADMIN；Windows 需管理员 + wintun.dll）。日常推荐：`tun call`（1:1 电话）、`tun join <hub>`（网状频道）、`tun status` / `tun peers` / `tun down`。也可用 `tun up --role phone|hub|spoke`。前台别名：`tun serve` / `tun connect`。丢包路径建议 `--cc bbr3`。双栈虚拟 IP：172.24.0.0/16 与 fd24:ac18::/64（省略 --tun-ip/--tun-ip6 时冲突则自动换址）— 见 docs/subsystems/tun.md。"

# --- tun-ip6 help ---
msgid "Override this node's virtual IP (default: derived from its EndpointId, inside 172.24.0.0/16). Omit to auto-pick a free address."
msgstr "覆盖本节点虚拟 IP（默认由 EndpointId 派生，落在 172.24.0.0/16）。省略则冲突时自动换址。"

msgid "Override this node's IPv6 VIP (default: derived in fd24:ac18::/64). Omit to auto-pick a free address."
msgstr "覆盖本节点 IPv6 虚拟 IP（默认派生在 fd24:ac18::/64）。省略则冲突时自动换址。"

msgid "Dial a `tun serve` hub, install 172.24.0.0/16 and fd24:ac18::/64 on the TUN, receive the mesh roster, and attempt direct links to other spokes (packets prefer direct; otherwise via hub). Equivalent to `tun up --foreground --role spoke --to <hub>`."
msgstr "拨号到 `tun serve` 中枢，在 TUN 上安装 172.24.0.0/16 与 fd24:ac18::/64，接收成员表，并尝试与其他 spoke 直连（优先直连，否则经中枢）。等同于 `tun up --foreground --role spoke --to <hub>`。"

msgid "`--identity-passphrase` is visible in `ps` and shell history; prefer LINK_P2P_PASSPHRASE"
msgstr "`--identity-passphrase` 会出现在 `ps` 与 shell 历史中；请优先使用 LINK_P2P_PASSPHRASE"
